  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "主链路（源码确认）",
      "items": [
        "iOS 先 multipart POST /v1/imports/uploads，幂等头 X-RAI-Sync-Batch 恒等于 payloadHash（apps/ios/RAI/HealthKitSync.swift:2168-2176）",
        "路由先取单写者闸再建任务：acquire(\"import source enqueue\") → importWorker.create(...) → 202（apps/api/src/routes/import-routes.ts:16-30）",
        "任务先写进 runtime.sqlite 的 import_jobs 才算受理；持久化失败会从 jobs 映射里回滚（apps/api/src/import-worker.ts:384-392）",
        "默认车道在 BEGIN IMMEDIATE 内完成解析、局部归一、登记 recompute_jobs 与写回执，然后一次 COMMIT（apps/api/src/direct-sync-ingest.ts:448-469、509-524、584-587）",
        "分析任务由 RecomputeWorker 在 worker 线程里认领并跑完三段计算（apps/api/src/recompute-worker.ts:63-84）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "单写者、租约与取消",
      "items": [
        "MutationCoordinator.acquire() 冲突时抛 409 / code mutation_conflict（apps/api/src/mutation-coordinator.ts:1-25）",
        "TaskAdmissionScheduler 全进程只允许一个 CPU 密集写者，FIFO 由 waiting 集合决定（apps/api/src/task-admission.ts:9-39）",
        "重算的写许可只在短写窗口内持有，长计算用 gate.yieldIfStale() 让路（apps/api/src/recompute-worker.ts:63-84、packages/application/src/write-gate.ts:20-31）",
        "换库前 readStores.beginReplace() 排空读租约，超时抛 database_busy(409)（apps/api/src/read-store-manager.ts:94-122）",
        "取消：queued 直接置 cancelled；running 置 cancel_requested 后终止子进程/线程；phase=activate 时不可取消（apps/api/src/import-worker.ts:280-301）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "状态取值与发布指针",
      "items": [
        "recompute_jobs.status 只允许 queued / running / succeeded / failed / cancelled（packages/storage-sqlite/src/database.ts:483-499）",
        "认领任务会写 status='running' 与 progress_phase='claimed'（packages/storage-sqlite/src/recompute-job-repository.ts:109-120）",
        "runFullRecompute 顺序执行 feature_extraction → training_metrics → model_replay（packages/application/src/services/recompute-pipeline.ts:195-236）",
        "发布是同库内的单行指针 upsert：active_model_run(singleton=1) → model_run_id，并清空 active prediction model（packages/storage-sqlite/src/model-run-repository.ts:212-218）",
        "读端始终是只读连接 + active_* 视图，只有已发布 run 可见（packages/storage-sqlite/src/database.ts:545-553）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "旁路与未知",
      "items": [
        "本时序画的是默认直连车道；直连被拒（非 typescript 引擎、无主库、载荷是完整快照等）时同一 worker 改走候选库 + rename 换库的维护路径（apps/api/src/direct-sync-plan.ts:47-56、apps/api/src/import-worker.ts:626-645）",
        "启用 Rust 引擎会让直连车道返回 engine_rust 否决，因此该时序在生产开启 Rust 时不成立（apps/api/src/direct-sync-plan.ts:51）",
        "Python/ONNX 预测训练是独立支路，不在本次导入时序内（packages/application/src/prediction-training-runner.ts:550-560）",
        "UNKNOWN：本次审计为只读静态分析，没有启动服务或浏览器；图上的顺序与事务边界来自源码，实际耗时、并发交错与真机轮询节奏未实测"
      ]
    }
  ]
